msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"You're not bad. So how about it? Wanna try and guess\r\n"
"the number on one of the dice?"
msgstr ""
"Non sei male. Allora, che ne dici? Vuoi provare a indovinare il numero su "
"uno dei dadi?"

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Not too bad! You're not bad. So how about it? Wanna try and guess\r\n"
"the numbers on both dice?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"Nice one... If you can win again, do you wanna try playing\r\n"
"against the house, one-on-one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Dealer"
msgstr "Croupier"
